WEBVTT

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:22.040
"Venus Cup"

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.830
<i>We want to make it bloom! (our dream)</i>

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:55.290
<i>We want to perform! (in an ensemble)</i>

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:59.950
<i>Let's shine so much that we're blinding</i>

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:03.830
<i>Shine like stars</i>

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:09.120
<i>Wow... let's start running.</i> Wow... to beyond our dream!

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:14.450
<i>Let's make new days. Here we go!</i>

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:19.700
<i>Our feelings that have been made</i> into song are overflowing (Wow Wow)

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:22.450
<i>Facing the dream we're aiming for</i>

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.910
<i>(Because I'm sure we can reach it)</i>

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:30.750
<i>You can't start if you don't</i> believe in yourself (This story)

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:35.660
<i>Our feelings resound with each other (We are)</i>

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:39.830
<i>We grow stronger each time we clash</i>

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:41.290
<i>I'm sure that's</i>

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:42.910
<i>What a bond is...</i>

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:48.200
<i>The smile on your face when you look at me</i>

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:49.660
<i>Gives me</i>

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:50.790
<i>The answer</i>

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:53.450
<i>We want you to know! (the beat of our hearts)</i>

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.910
<i>We want to connect! (to the passionate melody)</i>

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:58.750
<i>If you want the future you desire</i>

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:03.700
<i>Then we need to change this into a new world</i>

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:06.450
<i>We are singing a shining song for you.</i>

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:11.000
<i>Shining so much that we're</i> blinding, Stars' Ensemble!

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.700
<i>On the stage called "youth"</i>

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:24.750
"Episode 8: Rift"

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:48.750
"Chiaki Morisawa"

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:53.250
"Midori Takamine"

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:20.500
"Band Club"

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:30.660
"Kanata Shinkai"

00:18:52.080 --> 00:19:00.950
"Tsukasa Suou"

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:05.080
"Ritsu Sakuma"

00:20:57.830 --> 00:21:00.580
<i>We'll smile when we're happy</i>

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:03.410
<i>And yes, sometimes get hurt</i>

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:06.450
<i>We'll share
the same feelings</i>

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.830
<i>And head to tomorrow</i>

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.620
<i>Come on, make the dream come true</i>

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:14.370
<i>Transcend the conventional rules</i>

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:19.620
<i>Because there are songs
that can redraw the world...</i>

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:25.540
<i>Here in our hands</i>

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:27.910
<i>Go further than anyone else!</i>

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:30.790
<i>(So higher star)
To where the hope gleams</i>

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:34.250
<i>(Reach for the star)
Become constellations twinkling to each other</i>

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.660
<i>Trickstar</i>

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:39.000
<i>Go way! With the light that begins here</i>

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.160
<i>(Starting the life)</i> With the light called "possibility"

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:47.950
<i>The Rebellion Star will change the future</i>

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:02.000
<i>I push forward on this path! (Ha!)</i>

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:18.540
<i>Clad in the pride that was passed down to me</i>

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:24.500
<i>The will to rule in my eye</i>

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:30.370
<i>On this unending journey to perfect my art</i>

00:22:30.370 --> 00:22:35.700
<i>I use this body to the fullest</i>

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:38.750
<i>My ambition</i>

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:41.620
<i>Is unwavering</i>

00:22:41.620 --> 00:22:42.910
<i>Come, let us go</i>

00:22:42.910 --> 00:22:47.540
<i>It's time to let our lives bloom</i>

00:22:47.540 --> 00:22:53.950
<i>Shine, crimson moon, and dance gaily</i>

00:22:53.950 --> 00:22:59.290
<i>All or nothing (ha!) once in a lifetime (ha!)</i> unshakable conviction

00:22:59.290 --> 00:23:05.410
<i>Captivate with unparalleled techniques</i> matched by no one

00:23:05.410 --> 00:23:12.250
<i>Strong bonds (ha!) passionate souls (ha!)</i> all meet here (ha!)

00:23:45.660 --> 00:23:49.000
"Episode 9"
"Counterattack"
